<title>USA: Metro completes two acquisitions.</title>
<headline>Metro completes two acquisitions.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metro Networks Inc said Monday it had completed the acquisitions of TWI Networks Inc for $3.7 million and Airborne Traffic Network Inc for $1.5 million.</p>
<p>TWI is a provider of local travel and news services. Airborne Traffic provides traffic services to 16 radio station affiliates in Kansas City, Mo., and Omaha, Neb.</p>
<p>Metro Networks provides traffic reporting services and supplies local news, sports, weather and other information reporting services to the television and radio broadcast industries.</p>
